          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 16,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "Now Sarai, Abram’s wife, bore him no children. She had a servant, an Egyptian, whose name was Hagar.",
      "ko": "아브람의 아내 사래는 생산치 못하였고 그에게 한 여종이 있으니 애굽 사람이요 이름은 하갈이라",
      "source_text_hash": "6717af45fa3786a96f3e0b7fbc75b40a376ce05ee87523dfbd16920611cb5886",
      "translation_text_hash": "050b7ab2cc7058d42a5b611962c4598f6b72b1eb49f6dbb5b815b4a8547330a4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
