      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 16,
          "verse": 4
        }
      ],
      "en": "He went in to Hagar, and she conceived. When she saw that she had conceived, her mistress was despised in her eyes.",
      "ko": "아브람이 하갈과 동침하였더니 하갈이 잉태하매 그가 자기의 잉태함을 깨닫고 그 여주인을 멸시한지라",
      "source_text_hash": "9a5312d150f0b34de41e2ef6a952d0896224b2f432fb59eb26bf21daf3342503",
      "translation_text_hash": "8af7c2c1f77fa9042e5089c234ead64d851ca907f8f13a0e8750cf660d919a8c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "아브람이 하갈과 동침하였더니 하갈이 잉태하매 그가 자기의 잉태함을 깨닫고 그 여주인을 멸시한지라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "8af7c2c1f77fa9042e5089c234ead64d851ca907f8f13a0e8750cf660d919a8c"
      ]
